				<span class="bg-sky-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-sky-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-sky-200 dark:border-slate-600 dark:text-sky-500 text-sm">
					#1 Unofficial Whatsapp Gateway
