				<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M15.493 6.935a.75.75 0 0 1 .072 1.058l-7.857 9a.75.75 0 0 1-1.13 0l-3.143-3.6a.75.75 0 0 1 1.13-.986l2.578 2.953l7.292-8.353a.75.75 0 0 1 1.058-.072m5.025.085c.3.285.311.76.025 1.06l-8.571 9a.75.75 0 0 1-1.14-.063l-.429-.563a.75.75 0 0 1 1.076-1.032l7.978-8.377a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-.026" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
